WEBVTT

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.100
Lady Sophie's Royal Guard, assemble!

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:06.060
We've lost Lady Sophie!

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:06.780
Chanko?

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:07.860
Where could she be?

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:08.530
This is bad!

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.870
She must've gotten lost somewhere on school grounds again.

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:13.730
There's no doubt she's in trouble.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.620
We must find her, and quickly!

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:16.310
Aye!

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:18.330
Affirmative-chanko!

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.790
Lady Sophie!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.850
Where are you-chanko?

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.410
Lady Sophie!

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:25.460
Huh?

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.920
Houjou just left, said she was off to PriPara.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.630
What!?

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:36.110
I can't believe Lady Sophie left for Pripara on her own!

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:39.450
She couldn't possibly make it there without us...

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:42.560
Lady Sophie!

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:47.390
There you are!

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:10.020
How will we decide a winner with such a perfect show from both SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé?

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:14.290
You're on top again-kuma!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.420
Our audience has gotten louder too!

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:21.160
Yeah! There's especially tons of new Sophie fans!

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.270
You think?

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:28.050
Maybe some fans didn't like your new image and left, but you've made a lot of new ones!

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.440
I'm calculating a 20 percent growth!

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:37.540
All your hard work, both on and off stage,
is clearly pri-paying off!

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:40.900
You even came to PriPara on your own today!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:46.870
Yes. Even if Miss Meganee and a lot of others helped me find my way.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.210
That's still amazing progress!

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:52.830
Okay! Just one month til the Christmas Idol Grand Prix!

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:56.930
Let's get that Paradise Coord! Fight! No mercy!

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.460
[catchprases overlapping]

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:10.190
I feel as though the Royal Guard has been of no help at all lately...

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.510
You said it-chanko.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.900
Maybe... Could it be...

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:20.340
that Lady Sophie no longer has need of us?

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:23.110
I cosmic get what you mean.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.900
Miss Cosmo!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:26.090
That Sophie...

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:30.040
She's been trying to do everything on her own lately, even at home.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.710
And she always needed my help before.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.500
I hardly even feel like an older sister anymore.

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:41.670
But I can't get in the way now that she's trying to find her own wings!

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:43.880
In the way...

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:48.600
Right! Plus she has her teammates, Lala and Mireille.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:53.030
Oh no! I've gotta be at a meeting soon!

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:54.490
Cosmic bye!

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.460
Are we just getting in the way?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.150
Maybe we, too...

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.910
must learn to fly on our own!

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:13.230
I wonder what's going on with Sadako and the others.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.000
She said they have something important to talk about...

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:19.790
Lights out?

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.290
The season for leaves to fall and dance in the wind,

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:30.380
has come!

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:34.930
And on this fine day, we stand before you,

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.690
ready to turn a new leaf.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:44.600
We wish to announce that from this day forth, Lady Sophie's Royal Guard

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:45.980
is disbanded!

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:46.860
Chanko!

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.320
Whaaat?!

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:53.030
The joy we felt when trading Friend Tickets with Lady Sophie...

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.360
Trading Friend Tickets.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.100
Chanko!

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:58.400
The bliss of seeing Lady Sophie's perfect performances.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.370
Perfect!

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:00.160
Chanko!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:03.070
The excitement of witnessing Lady Sophie's Fancy Mode.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:05.590
The day we swore to protect her!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:06.210
Chanko!

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:07.260
Stop, stop!

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.810
Why? Why are you suddenly disbanding?

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:15.720
Isn't it obvious? Lady Sophie no longer needs us.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:19.560
She can already do everything on her own so splendidly.

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:24.210
As such, we must say our farewells to Lady Sophie.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.550
We've decided we must go our separate ways.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.360
You can't do that! I'm <i>so</i> against this!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:30.240
Besides...

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:32.580
Don't try to stop us, Lady Sophie!

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:38.960
Even if you oppose this decision, our resolve will not sway.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:46.380
I understand.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:48.330
What?!

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:50.460
It's okay if you want to disband.

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:51.840
N-No way!

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.340
Just like my sister...

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:58.810
No, even more than her...

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:03.640
You've already helped me so much for so long.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:09.030
If you want to find new things for yourselves, I wouldn't want to stop you.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.730
Lady Sophie...

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.830
I will be fine on my own.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.750
Thank you for everything!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:20.960
Thank you so much!

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:22.170
Thank you.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:25.520
Retirement ceremony-chanko!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:31.550
Chanko!

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:36.620
Of these days I spent being your shield...

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:44.270
I, Guardian Sadako, will never forget a moment!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.190
Troops! Dismissed!

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.850
Farewell, Lady Sophie!

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:52.670
Chanko!

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:56.270
Goodbye.

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:02.940
It's really over.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.780
Well, that's done, but what are we supposed to do now?

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:11.110
Now that I think about it, since we've never picked up any other hobbies or interests,

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:13.900
what <i>are</i> we supposed to do now?

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:14.800
Chanko!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.470
Well, joining a club is what being in middle school is all about!

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:25.750
Ah, how wonderful it is to have all this time after school all to myself!

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:26.690
Wha-huuuh?!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.480
Wh-What have I been drawing?

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:33.450
W-Well, studying is more important anyway.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:37.420
I'll study hard to make it to the best high school around!

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:40.910
Uh, so, what's the evolution of humans look like—gah!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:47.080
Ahh! Everything looks like Lady Sophie!

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.090
Excuse me!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:53.720
Today I would like to put up these Dressing Pafé posters... Hm?

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.700
Way ahead of you!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.140
Keep dreaming! How's this?

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.210
Then I'll just...

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.390
We've made Lady Sophie!

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:08.270
That's great! I've photographed a lot of idols, and you're a real natural!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:11.340
My Idol Rank is Sexy!

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.280
Gravure idol-chanko!

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:16.920
Very nice! Now, just smile a little wider, please!

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:19.670
Try thinking of someone you really like.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:20.700
Someone I like...

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.700
Someone I like!

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:25.660
What is it?

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:30.590
I'll wait to start my gravure career in high school-chanko!

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.480
What is it, Sophie?

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.790
Sophie, what is it-pri?

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:39.720
Nothing, just brushing my hair...

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:42.850
Your brush isn't a brush, Sophie! It's a crayfish!

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:46.770
Owie...

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.730
One, two, three, four...

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.820
Sophie, what's up with your clothes?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.820
And footwear.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:00.530
Whoopsie... I'll go change.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:04.490
How much whoopsie do you need to end up like that-pri?

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:06.640
Is she gonna be okay?

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:11.360
Don't you think she might be pretty shocked about the Royal Guard's disbandment?

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:14.300
According to my calculations, the Royal Guard...

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:18.680
Mireille, stop standing around like that, you're getting in the way of everyone.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.220
What?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:22.160
How about an apology instead-pri?

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:23.220
No way!

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:28.070
It's your fault the Royal Guard has been hassling us now.

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:30.940
What, you've seen them?

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.190
Some of them came by our store.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:42.200
This red ginger is just the color of Lady Sophie's hair!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:48.020
Mom made them a bunch of stuff they never ate!

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:49.240
Rage max!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.470
Relax.

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:54.380
I saw some too. They built a Sophie face out of go pieces and bawled their eyes out.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:57.340
They're that out of sorts?

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:11.850
It's no good. We just can't forget Lady Sophie.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.890
Sadako!

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.710
Chanko!

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.110
Is something wrong?

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:22.320
We're in trouble! Sophie's gone missing!

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:24.530
Whaaat?!

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:54.750
Huh?

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:56.620
What's the matter?

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.030
You can't get on a train with PriTickets.

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:04.740
Uh, how do I get to Akipapara Station from here?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.990
Just board this train.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:08.950
I see.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:11.870
Might I ask what your business in Akipapara is?

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.890
I'm going to buy Red Flash.

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:15.950
Red Flash?

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:18.430
My sister told me

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:22.780
that they sell the best Red Flash at Akipapara.

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.060
Thank you.

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:46.840
Huh? Where's the Red Flash?

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:50.440
Oh? You're going on the Red Splash too?

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.500
You need to change trains at the next stop for that.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:54.390
I see.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:13:00.170
We've looked all over! PriPara, Parajuku, at school!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.690
I'll handle it!

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:07.040
Troops! Start Lady Sophie Location Protocol!

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:07.470
Aye!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.470
Aye-aye!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.280
Hello, I'm from the Royal Guard...

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:11.430
Please respond!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:15.240
Commander! Kanagawa Branch Member No. 286 has reported sighting someone

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:17.900
that looks like Lady Sophie on Pritter!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:23.030
Member No. 389 has reported trading friend tickets with Lady Sophie!

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.910
We have a GPS reading at southwestern Odapara!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:29.720
Good work! Begin analysis!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.810
Complete! Move out to Paratsuru Point!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:40.410
They're good. Took no time to locate her.

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:42.340
That's the Royal Guard for you!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.410
Chanko!

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:44.800
Move out!

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:49.760
Lady Sophie!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.110
This is weird! She's nowhere to be seen!

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:55.540
Impossible! The GPS lead was solid!

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:59.480
I've found Lady Sophie's scent on these rocks-chanko!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.010
She couldn't have fallen in...

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.170
Over there!

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:11.750
Lady Sophie!

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.660
Oh, it's you!

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:15.980
H-How?

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.580
Thank you!

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:21.720
Wh-What's going on?

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.830
What were you doing there?

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:26.110
Do you have any idea how worried we were?

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:27.890
I wanted to help.

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:28.800
Help?

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:34.010
I heard everyone was down, so I wanted to get Red Flash,

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.540
to snap you out of it.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:41.010
But I got a bit lost.

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.220
A bit?

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:45.560
How lost do you have to be to end up on a fishing boat?

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:46.690
But in exchange...

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.660
Here! You can have this!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:54.120
Lady Sophie... Just for us...

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:57.600
I couldn't find any Red Flash, but...

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.330
I hope this helps.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:03.260
I'm just so glad you're fine.

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:06.530
Thank you so much for this tilefish.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.800
But we must go now.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.730
What, you're leaving?

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:12.420
Our duty is done.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.130
Yes...

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:16.970
Excuse us.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:19.370
Bye bye.

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:26.900
Octopus.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:34.580
Uh, err, all your make-up equipment is on the second shelf from the left in the dressing room.

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:38.590
S-So we'll really be going now.

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:39.260
Yes...

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:43.540
Garden eel.

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:49.470
And do try not to mistake toothpaste for the foam soap.

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:53.470
Clams and stuff.

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:55.930
And soap bars are not rice cakes!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.890
And now we really really will be going!

00:16:00.550 --> 00:16:01.230
Okay...

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.770
Are you really okay with this?

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.500
Don't stop us!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:14.200
Continuing to protect Lady Sophie as her Royal Guard would only be stifling her!

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:19.250
I can't keep holding everyone back.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.460
Ahem.

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:24.050
You're free to try and be as considerate as you want with each other,

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:26.920
but could I just say what's been on my mind?

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:31.630
To begin with, protection isn't what idols' supporters generally do anyway.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:33.240
What?!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.720
Your duty toward an idol are as follows:

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:40.060
Intently, passionately, restlessly cheer for your idol and have fun doing it!

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:42.680
R-Really?

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:47.920
Basically, there's no good reason at all that you should be disbanding.

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.160
Whaaat?!

00:16:49.160 --> 00:16:51.040
Oh, I see how it is!

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.130
Pshu...

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:55.910
Lady Sophie!

00:16:58.030 --> 00:16:59.370
That's nice.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:00.840
Lady Sophie!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.400
It's a fresh start for the Royal Guard!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:07.540
We want to see that solo show again!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:08.380
Chanko!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.100
Yeah, yeah, that one!

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:11.100
Do that one again!

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:12.340
Just every now and then!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:13.960
Very well.

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:17.420
Welcome to Prism Stone.

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:19.560
Please enter your My Tickets.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:26.060
Scan the appropriate amount of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:27.980
Coord Change Start!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.890
Lady Sophie!

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:48.830
I love this version of Lady Sophie too!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:53.300
Have you been good, my little cagebirds?

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.010
Yes!

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:58.970
I haven't been that good myself...

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.430
So cool!

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:05.140
You should go out to the sea sometime.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.950
The sea can make you honest with yourself.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:14.420
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:25.230
Liberation Maiden

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:27.230
Valkyria!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.860
Cyalume Change!

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:16.040
I'm so moved!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.390
You're the best, Sophie!

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:18.110
Pri!

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:28.760
Lady Sophie, we will never ever stop...

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:30.380
...cheering for you!

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.360
Chanko!

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:32.910
Thank you!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:37.210
It's... that girl!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.920
Falulu!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.590
Oh, it's Lala, with the Prism Voice.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.540
You remembered my name!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:48.290
Yes.

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:52.240
Falulu is trying to remember various things about PriPara right now.

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:53.100
Various things?

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.550
Did you know?

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:59.070
When you perform in PriPara a lot your Idol Rank will go up.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:02.280
And when it does many good things will happen.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.020
I see!

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:08.720
You seem a bit more on top of things than last time.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:09.520
And then there's...

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:11.790
Falulu! Bad girl!

